@zamoyski
title: Maurycy Zamoyski, a non-partisan candidate fielded by the ChZJN. Largest estate and the biggest land owner. Serving as the **<span style="color: #CCC;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">ish</span>** envoy to **<span style="color: #000091;">Pa</span><span style="color: #CCC;">r</span><span style="color: #E1000F;">is</span>**.
on-arrival: candidate += 1
go-to: candidate
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/portraits/ZamoyskiMaurycy.jpg

His candidacy is supported by the ChZJN.

@courtenay
title: Jan Baudouin de Courtenay
on-arrival: candidate += 1
go-to: candidate
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/portraits/CourtenayJan.jpg

His candidacy is supported by the BMN and Other minority parties.

@wojciechowski
title: Stanisław Wojciechowski
on-arrival: candidate += 1
go-to: candidate
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/portraits/WojciechowskiStanisław.jpg

Wincenty Witos was perceived as a person communicating with the right and not paying attention to the interests of rural villages. Hence, Stanisław Wojciechowski was fielded as a compromise candidate representing the Centrist and Moderates of the PSL-P.

His candidacy is supported by the PSL-P and NPR.

@communist
title: How about the Communists?
view-if: candidate >= 3

The Communist delegates have decided to Boycott the Presidential Election.

- @pps

